# Project: SpiderFeet Python stack

## Stack

- **Python 3.11+** via Poetry (`pyproject.toml`)
- **Legacy entry:** `sf.py`, `sfcli.py`, `modules/sfp_*.py`
- **New API layer:** FastAPI (stage 2+), served via `start.ps1` at repo root
- **Map database:** TypeDB 3.8+, database name `spiderfeet-map`, schema `.seed/spiderfeet_map.tql`
- **Tests:** pytest under `.tests/`; run with `poetry run pytest`

## Key paths

| Artifact | Path |
|----------|------|
| OSINT catalogue (`service_state`, `fixture_category`) | `.docs/analysis/osint_services.json` |
| Module smoke seeds | `.docs/analysis/module_test_seeds.json` |
| Stage 4 corpus guide (agents) | `.docs/analysis/stage4_seed_corpus_and_tests.md` |
| Nuggets | `.docs/analysis/nuggets.json` |
| Module taxonomy | `.docs/quarantine_modules.md`, `.docs/non_osint_modules.md` |
| TypeDB connection (local dev) | JSON config file (externalised; no secrets in repo) |
| Map read/bootstrap | `spiderfeet/map/read.py`, `spiderfeet/map/bootstrap.py` |
| Tests / scan_ui services | `spiderfeet/api/services/tests.py`, `scan_ui.py`, `scan_targets.py` |

## Skills

Use `.cursor/skills/typedb/` and `.cursor/skills/typedb-bridge/` for schema and ORM work.

## Conventions

- Prefer extending existing SpiderFoot module patterns until rebrand (stage 1) lands
- Regenerate analysis JSON after module metadata changes: `python .docs/analysis/analyse_modules.py`
- API changes require OpenAPI accuracy and pytest coverage per GOV-05
- Do not add new OSINT modules without SPEC-002 traceability and operator approval
- After catalogue or seed changes: `sync_service_state.py` / `sync_fixture_category.py` when applicable; see `proj-04-spiderfeet-stage4-corpus.mdc`
